<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Dec 18 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Dec 18 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED DECEMBER 11</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............785,500 up.....6,600</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......704,500 up.....1,200</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......499,900 down...2,000</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED DECEMBER 18</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....783,726 up....13,662</p>
<p> Financial companies.......597,230 up.....5,558</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,793 up.......951</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,548 up.......952</p>
</text>
